title: "aigent-talking-head: an open-source talking-head video editor for coding agents"
abstract: "A local pipeline that turns one phone clip into a captioned vertical reel for TikTok, Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts, with Whisper transcription, word-timed kinetic captions, motion graphics planned from the transcript, platform export presets, agent skills and an MCP server."
